@ryanphillipthomas there is no supported way to do that right now. Setup only asks for a developer token when the bundled one is rejected, not when it's throttled, and a Music User Token only works with the developer token it was issued under. Pairing your own developer token with a user token from Music Assistant's sign-in won't work, and the advanced manual user token field still uses the bundled developer token. Whether to add a field for your own developer token is still open on our side. The fewer requests in 2.10.7 and 2.11 are the main fix for now.

